    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 16, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "第二天午餐过后。<br>\n看到蕾雅正要走出餐厅，我喊住了她。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 18, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Default"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "接下来是放风时间，你们是要推进舞台剧制作进度吧？<br>\n希望也能让我做点什么。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "刚才用餐的时候，众人也是围绕着蕾雅<br>\n一直热烈地讨论舞台剧的事。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "如今，制作舞台剧这件事<br>\n已经变成把我们联系起来的纽带了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Default"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 29, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 31, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "谢谢你能这么快就来帮忙。<br>\n我想想啊……希罗有什么专长呢？", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Leia001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 33, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "某种意义上来说，这问题真不好回答。<br>\n基本上无论什么工作我都有自信能做好。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 35, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这样啊，跟艾玛说的一样呢。<br>\n不管是学业还是运动，各方各面都完美无缺。<br>\n到手的荣誉数不胜数。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Leia002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 37, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 39, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……艾玛说的？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 41, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "是啊。为了让我明白你是多么厉害的人，<br>\n她跟我说了很多哦。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Leia003"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 43, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Angry"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……原来是这样。<br>\n知道自己不在场时被他人说三道四，<br>\n不是什么很开心的事。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Pensive"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "抱歉。是我主动去问艾玛的。<br>\n希望你不要责怪她。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Leia004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "蕾雅垂着眼，一副深感抱歉的模样。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Default"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……我并不打算责怪谁。<br>\n所以说到底，我该干什么？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Hiro005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Default"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊啊……<br>\n要不希罗就先看看其他人<br>\n在干什么吧。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Leia005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "都看过以后，就选一件感觉自己能做到，<br>\n或者自己想做的事情去做，你觉得怎么样？", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Leia006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "没有异议。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv03_Hiro006"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 67, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
